WEBVTT

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:28.610
Doushu-sama...

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.440
I've brought you supper.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.620
Oh, thanks.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.480
It smells good,

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.130
I was just getting hungry.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.820
I'm glad to hear that.

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:51.080
Here, please enjoy, Ensei-sama.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:55.700
Oh? Dumpling soup! What a luxury.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.280
Itadakimasu.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.920
Mmm, delicious!

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:17.930
And here's yours.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.190
Thank you.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.980
I'll have it later.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.300
Hey, Eigetsu.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.260
Yes?

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.700
Aren't you being a bit cold towards Kourin?

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:46.390
Was I being cold to her?

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:50.650
Ah, well, maybe "cold" is too strong, but how should I put it?

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.760
You seem to be more distant.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.650
Has Kourin done something to you?

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:57.170
No!

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.270
I feel a little sorry when I see her.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.840
Kourin is emotionally unstable of late.

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:07.830
She sighs often and seems dazed.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.340
Then, she gets frustrated or almost cries.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:13.690
Why have you let this go on?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.440
I'd forgotten...

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:21.190
My hands are full just taking care of myself.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.870
It's been a lot of fun,

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.500
but I cannot forget who I am anymore.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:33.460
I don't have enough energy to share with someone else.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.750
Well, I don't have the right to say things about the two of you,

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.270
but it wouldn't hurt to eat that, right?!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.510
Ah, no, of course not! Itadakimasu!

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.510
Oh! This is from old man Hei?

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:46.930
Mmm, delicious!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.550
It's been a while.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.000
Hey, Eigetsu.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:54.830
Yes?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.100
There's news from Koringun.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:01.500
A religious group called "Jyasen-kyou" is doing something fishy in the mountains.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.400
"Jyasen-kyou," you say?

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:08.490
Yeah, and suspiciously enough,

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.500
the founder of the group is called "Senya."

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.150
Senya... that's...

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.110
Sakujun-san?!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.850
Could... Could he be...?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:25.050
I don't know, but I've got a really bad feeling about this.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:36.860
As expected, Governor Kai's arrival has been delayed.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.340
Is that so?

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:42.110
Well, the mountain passage from Kokushuu is steep.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.570
Some delay is unavoidable.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.940
He'll be tired from the journey.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:50.200
I heard that Governor Kai is rather old.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:55.750
That's true.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:06:00.960
He is old, but he's not weak in the least.

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:07.820
He's the eldest official in active service, probably over 80.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.780
Even so, not even we can outshine him.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.750
From Kokushuu's rank among the top provinces in the country, you can tell he's a renowned retainer.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.430
He flew back and forth between the capital and the provinces

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.910
and made every effort to stabilize this country.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.410
Wow, is that so?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.470
He has virtues that make even
Shou-Taishi and Sou-Taifu bow to him.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.890
The argument between the previous emperor and Governor Kai was quite a spectacle.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:38.740
The previous emperor did not want to lose him and worried about his advanced age,

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:44.240
so the Emperor rejected Kai Yu-sama's repeated requests to be appointed Governor of Sashuu.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:45.600
Of Sashuu?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:51.690
Yes, Kai You-sama really wanted to be appointed Governor there, but...

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:53.250
I see...

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.220
He was a really handsome man back in his day.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.690
If he were thirty years younger, perhaps even Shuurei-dono might've lost her heart to him.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:02.690
You think so?

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:09.070
Ah, by the way, Shuurei-dono, I heard Ryuuren is under your care again?

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:10.450
Ah, yes.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.740
He turned up suddenly yesterday.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.840
Kokujun is with him as well, apparently?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.750
That's right. They seem to be good friends.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:23.040
Why didn't they just come to my house...

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.340
He seems to dislike his foolish fourth elder brother.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.760
In that case, maybe I should ask you to take care of him.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.760
Urgh! P-Please don't do that!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.570
Fantastic! That was awesome, Ryuuren-san!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:53.400
But I'm not satisfied with the middle part. It was a bit slow.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.310
What do you mean by slow?

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:58.760
Was it? I thought it was fierce and stylish.

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.290
Stylish?

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:04.320
Shuurei-san, you seem to be exhausted.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:09.250
I feel like I've run as fast as I could, or I've labored in the fields till sunset.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:12.820
Hmm, that's a compliment requiring deep thought.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.070
It's not a compliment...

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:18.750
By the way, Ryuuren-san, Shuurei-san's house is the most comfortable of all the places

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:21.370
where we stayed, isn't it?

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.270
Where did you stay before?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:27.980
At first we stayed at my family residence in Kiyou,

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.360
but that house hasn't been repaired in a long time.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.040
Ryuuren-san called it "tasteful," though.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.680
So, well, we went to Sou-Taifuu's residence.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.420
To Sou-Taifuu's?

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.180
We met in the palace by coincidence.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:05.730
"If you're looking for a place to stay, just stay with me," he kindly offered.

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:10.610
Didn't you say, "Otherwise, I won't stop playing the flute"?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.570
That flute has become a weapon more lethal than a sword!

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:16.680
We stayed in many other places.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:22.330
For example, we stayed with people we met in the capital in return for teaching them cards.

00:09:25.310 --> 00:09:27.860
Cards... another lethal weapon.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:33.540
This is the first time I've lived like this. I'm really enjoying it.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.650
Isn't that right, Ryuuren-san?

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.830
Ryuuren? Where are you?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.330
He's probably off on another journey.

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:41.870
A journey?!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:47.590
To Ryuuren-san, going for water or going to a neighboring province are both journeys.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.940
S-Say, Kokujun-san,

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.570
you sincerely believe Ryuuren's flute playing is good, right?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.490
Yes! Of course!

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:03.040
I don't have a lot of knowledge about music, and I'm slow to catch on to the latest fashions,

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:10.210
so I don't have the confidence to say that I fully understand Ryuuren-san's original and avant-garde flute performances.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:16.850
Even so, Ryuuren-san plays so seriously that his music must be of the foremost artistry!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.720
Music I can't even imagine, just like that!

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:23.960
To be able to hear that everyday, isn't that a luxury one can only dream of?

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.350
Living in a remote corner of the country where information fails to reach,

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.760
who would've thought that this would cause such harmful effects?

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:34.540
Kokujun-san has hardly ever heard the sound of a flute...

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.320
Erm, Kokujun-san...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.980
I really like Ryuuren-san.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:46.530
He listened patiently to my incoherent stories.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.480
He's a bit crazy,

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:53.160
but every day I wonder what might come out of that box of surprises.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:55.210
I actually look forward to it.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.530
He'll become a big name, he will.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:03.850
Shuurei, Kokujun.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:06.050
No...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.010
No!

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:14.630
You, you've pulled out the garden vegetables that I was growing so carefully!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.420
They're wonderfully ripe.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:21.220
You fool! If you'd waited another three days, they would've grown larger and tasted even better!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.040
I caught a glimpse of these vegetables in the garden...

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.730
The fragile white color and elegant line that can only be seen just before full ripening is splendid.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.050
I feel an improvisation coming on...

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:36.850
The title is, "Small Self-Sufficient Family, Gathering of the Whites"!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:38.780
Dono?

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.360
Stop joking around!

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:43.310
Taking other people's precious vegetables!
What were you thinking?!

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:44.050
If I take some more,

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:46.850
I think I can write a distinguished piece.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:52.510
Kokujun-san, who did you say would listen patiently to your stories?

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:55.480
Er, well, that was...?

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.460
Oh, Shuurei, white is fine but not silver.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:03.790
Watch out for the man with silver hair.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.510
What is he talking about?

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.650
I don't understand him!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.820
Just one other thing is missing.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.090
Let's go on a journey to find it.

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:27.520
Ryuuren-san...

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.780
Are you going on a journey?

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:32.530
Where?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.500
To the teahouse on the main road.

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:37.380
That sounds good. I'll accompany you.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.180
I feel tired all of sudden.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:45.610
Come to think of it...

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.570
Itadakimasu.

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:52.250
Seiran has run away!

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:53.380
I'm home.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.460
Father, welcome home.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.280
What is it? Did someone come with you?

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:02.490
N-No, no one's here. I'm alone.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.010
Oh, what is it then?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.570
Ah, I need to research something. Let's go.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.220
Er, is there any manjuu?

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.150
Father, you're acting strange.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:15.640
You think so?

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.100
Where are Ryuuren and his companion?

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:21.260
They just went out. It was disastrous.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.130
I'm glad I came after all.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:42.070
Honestly, we could've done this at the palace.

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:45.160
I won't be able to see her again for a while.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.570
This manjuu...

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:51.220
It's good.

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.320
You're not the only who won't be able to see Shuurei.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:56.380
Ryuuki-sama and I won't either.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:59.570
I don't care about that snot-nose kid!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.610
He doesn't need to marry her, just to inherit the family name!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.210
Reishin,

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.910
don't you know how painful it is to be told by a woman you truly love,

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:12.620
"Let's be good friends for the rest of our lives."

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.240
What's wrong with "good friends"?

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:17.740
Then let me ask you something.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:21.100
Suppose Shuurei found out that you're her uncle, and then said with a smile on her face,

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:24.170
"Let's be strangers for the rest of our lives."

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.010
What would you do?

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:30.040
At least you could use the fact you two are related,

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.770
but as a man and a woman, there'd be nothing left.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.230
If you are truly serious about it,

00:14:35.510 --> 00:14:38.420
no matter how idiotic you appear, you can't give up.

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:39.770
Just like me.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:46.280
I was probably one of the best in the world at not giving up.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.690
My wife turned me down countless times,

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.410
yet I wouldn't give up.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.540
After we were betrothed,

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:58.290
she then said, "We could also just stay friends."

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.060
That really hurt, you know.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.860
Sister said that?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.410
She could've lived on her own.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.960
I was the one who needed her.

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.890
Shuurei is just like my wife.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.510
After my wife passed away,

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:19.520
that small girl saved both Seiran and me.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:27.390
It will be difficult for Shuurei to marry for love.

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:31.920
Instead, it would be easier for her to agree to a political marriage.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.260
No way I'd let her marry for political reasons!

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:38.490
You brought that pile of marriage proposals, didn't you?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:43.500
I thought you said they were all suitable for Shuurei, who has received

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:47.130
an appointment from the Emperor and is a direct lineal descendant of the Kou family.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.350
If you consider the family's status, official rank, and potential,

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:53.660
I think this is a good selection of candidates.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:56.750
I'll never give her to the Ran family!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.410
Nor to any other of the seven families either!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:04.540
In fact, I don't want to give her away to any family!

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:07.210
Well, I guess keeping her in the Kou family is okay.

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:08.770
Hakuyuu-kun is a nice boy.

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:13.250
Even he could meet a girl from somewhere and run away!

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.770
Ah, that's a possibility.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.200
What are you trying to say, brother?

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:21.580
Isn't it you who wants to say something?

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:23.710
Kurou is making his move already.

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:28.440
I've educated Kouyuu to follow the path he wants!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:36.100
I'd rather have her as my wife than give her away to another man!

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.720
She's come back even more beautiful than before.

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:43.500
What if some good-for-nothing guy takes her away?!

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:46.820
Well, at the end of the day, Shuurei will decide.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.560
She is wise.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:51.420
I'll fight with all my power, brother.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:53.840
Hello?

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:57.200
Rin-san!

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:58.450
Is it good news?

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.660
I received a letter. The Merchants Guild has summoned us.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:08.170
My husband is working at the palace, so it will be only Shuurei-dono and me.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:08.710
What do you want to do?

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.160
It might just be a meet-and-greet occasion.
Do you still want to come along?

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.470
Yes, definitely! I'm coming!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:23.010
Eigetsu, old man Hei has sent another letter,

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.180
with top priority.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.420
Does it have something to do with "Jyasen-kyou" again?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:31.360
No, but they are continuing to investigate that.

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:35.470
This letter is about a strange illness that is spreading.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.160
A strange illness?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:43.000
East of Koringun, adjacent to the Senri Mountains, there's a village called Sekiei.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:48.080
In that village, numerous people are suffering from an unknown illness that inflames the belly.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:51.590
As a precaution, they want doctors and medicine sent from Houren.

00:17:52.140 --> 00:17:52.880
Ensei-san!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.800
What is it? Why are you looking so worried?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.810
That village, where is it in the Senri Mountains?

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.200
At the foot of Mount Ei. It's more like a town than a village.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:07.270
The stones mined from that mountain are suitable for inkstone, so the village is quite prosperous.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.880
Come to think of it, the Jyasen-kyou group is also active around there.

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.680
Is there some kind of connection between the two?

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.360
I'm sorry! I...

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.910
What's wrong, Eigetsu? Is something bothering you?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.890
I don't know yet, but...

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:34.850
I'll immediately write a letter to all the villages and towns in this region,

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:36.890
and to all the county officials.

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.600
Please prepare the government post horses.

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:43.730
If there are reports of snow foxes in these regions,

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:45.340
they must be dealt with immediately!

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.450
Snow foxes?

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:48.630
So what if they've been sighted?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.020
If so...

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.180
Thank you for the meal.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.850
Please hold on a moment.

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:25.140
Yes?

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:30.310
You aren't Eigetsu-sama, are you?

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.500
I congratulate you.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.720
You did well to notice.

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:37.900
Just as I thought, you are...

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:40.770
If you want to keep Eigetsu alive as long as possible,

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:43.960
you'd better keep alcohol away from him completely.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.340
That includes alcohol in food.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:49.590
He can't withstand even the smell of it.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:52.230
Who are you?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.830
You're too different from Eigetsu-sama!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.860
Are you trying to take over Eigetsu-sama?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.950
I'll tell you his real name.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:07.930
It's "Getsu."

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.720
Eigetsu is a name I gave him.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:16.980
I thought it was a perfect name for a man who chose to be my shadow.

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:20.840
Is this a woman's intuition? It sure is sharp.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:26.030
The stars have passed. Now his time will too, like falling sand.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:31.490
As you've guessed, To Eigetsu will soon disappear from this world.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:35.000
Forever.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:41.490
You're lying...

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.410
You're lying. It's all lies!

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:48.990
As I told you already,

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:54.070
if you really want him to live longer, keep all sources of alcohol away from him.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:54.860
Keep alcohol away...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.790
Well, it doesn't really matter,

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:02.730
but each time Yougetsu comes out, Eigetsu's life is whittled away.

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:09.240
Just because you added a few drops of alcohol to your plate, you brought me out.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:14.890
Your test has assisted in killing Eigetsu.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:21.390
Why won't you spend the time left more meaningfully?

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.600
Eigetsu has been doing so from the start!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.480
Doing things he wanted to do as much as possible,

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:30.260
and understanding as many things as he could,
I can respect his spirit for that.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:36.730
Still, it doesn't concern me what he does and if that leads to his death.

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:50.200
Before the national exam, To Eigetsu's time was already short.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.690
He won't last much longer.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.450
Even you, a legendary doctor, can't help?

00:21:56.770 --> 00:21:59.980
Don't be foolish. If you live long, you encounter many obstacles.

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:04.670
Occasionally, humans jump over those obstacles, which is why they're interesting.

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:09.890
Like Sa Enjun and that Doushu in Kokushuu.

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.150
How about Kou Shuurei?

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:17.330
Hmm, it's been a while since I last saw her. She's become very pretty.

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:19.520
She used to be so frail, but...

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:29.150
Eavesdropping? You've become rather ill-mannered, Hyou family!

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.230
I apologize.

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:40.300
It was such an unusual sight that I was tempted.

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:44.690
It's not so important that you had to come to Kiyou!

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:47.920
I'll go home, as soon as I get what I'm looking for.

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:51.050
If you wish to get home safely, leave empty-handed, kid.

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:54.430
A mere human who wishes for too much will destroy himself!

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:58.970
Fortunately or unfortunately, I'm not just a <i>mere</i> human.

00:22:59.680 --> 00:23:02.120
I'll do what I like.

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:07.820
Oh, by the way, something interesting will happen soon in Sashuu.

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:12.820
To Eigetsu may be able to see a blissful vision.

00:23:13.110 --> 00:23:17.350
Though it will be a momentary, frail dream.

00:24:45.970 --> 00:24:47.130
Uncle Kurou!

00:24:47.410 --> 00:24:48.580
Is this a souvenir?

00:24:48.580 --> 00:24:50.520
What delicious looking mandarins!

00:24:50.960 --> 00:24:53.840
Thank you for complimenting my work in Sashuu,

00:24:54.210 --> 00:24:56.840
but please keep on observing. I'll accomplish even more!
